{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2708\ufe0f<strong>Velocity Wings</strong>\u2708\ufe0f is an endless flying game where your goal is to fly 100KM through sheer perseverance! Earn all pilot medals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has no countdown timer, and no enemy planes chasing your tail. You can <strong>soar freely as you wish</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udc47This is your little plane. It looks cute, right? Don't underestimate it; it can fly forever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/extras/f15d1d700f20ef2e9a359e37b8107e7f.poster.avif?t=1757078219\" width=338 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/extras/f15d1d700f20ef2e9a359e37b8107e7f.webm?t=1757078219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/extras/f15d1d700f20ef2e9a359e37b8107e7f.mp4?t=1757078219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Pilot your little plane, using a series of high-difficulty maneuvers like turning, diving, and climbing to overcome various obstacles. Of course, there are plenty of rewards along the way\u2014keep an eye on this bright yellow star! The more you collect, the higher your score \ud83c\udf1f.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/extras/ba65960412fcc26c49a9c2a416751915.poster.avif?t=1757078219\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/extras/ba65960412fcc26c49a9c2a416751915.webm?t=1757078219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/extras/ba65960412fcc26c49a9c2a416751915.mp4?t=1757078219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udc47This blue glowing panel is a boost device. Just gently pass over it to give your little plane a speed boost, and it might even give you some extra fuel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/extras/1009db503d9c018e625590c91e75df88.poster.avif?t=1757078219\" width=374 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/extras/1009db503d9c018e625590c91e75df88.webm?t=1757078219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/extras/1009db503d9c018e625590c91e75df88.mp4?t=1757078219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Yes, your little plane can't stay boosted forever. Just like driving a car requires fuel, you need gas. But this little purple lightning bolt below can instantly refuel your plane, so keep that throttle pressed down and don't let go \ud83d\ude01.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/extras/1704a6d1711d2ecbcc3007bb10264ae5.poster.avif?t=1757078219\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/extras/1704a6d1711d2ecbcc3007bb10264ae5.webm?t=1757078219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/extras/1704a6d1711d2ecbcc3007bb10264ae5.mp4?t=1757078219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Next up is the main event. Don't be fooled by this ordinary, plain blue shield; it's actually a spatial warp device. Acquire it, and it will tear open a rift in reality for you to jump through. You can even grab a cup of coffee during the jump\u2014time to relax \ud83d\ude80.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/extras/8962a70e620dddf459643041992088de.poster.avif?t=1757078219\" width=338 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/extras/8962a70e620dddf459643041992088de.webm?t=1757078219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/extras/8962a70e620dddf459643041992088de.mp4?t=1757078219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">And of course, the ever-essential health item. It will come in very handy when your little plane accidentally brushes against an obstacle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/extras/3f76d16ded0f9e522c5be3f5ca26352a.poster.avif?t=1757078219\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/extras/3f76d16ded0f9e522c5be3f5ca26352a.webm?t=1757078219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/extras/3f76d16ded0f9e522c5be3f5ca26352a.mp4?t=1757078219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Additionally, the game features an experienced but camera-shy <strong>Flight Instructor</strong>. He's responsible for chattering in your ear. He usually sets the game's difficulty, starting simple and gradually increasing it. He might lend a hand when you need help, or he might not. I think you'll like him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget your goal. This game has a total of <strong>100 achievements</strong>. Earn a medal for every kilometer flown! Only truly persistent pilots can obtain the <strong>gold-inlaid medal</strong> engraved with &quot;100KM!&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/extras/21c76b17e64f1e4f3fdde1dcd3eeac16.avif?t=1757078219\" width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alright, you've now fully mastered this game. Begin your flight journey immediately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f Warning: The crash rate for the first flight is as high as 97% (unofficial data, but if you survive, you earn bragging rights!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2328\ufe0f</strong> Keyboard Controls: \u2191 \u2193 \u2190 \u2192 <strong>/</strong> <strong>WSAD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost: <strong>Spacebar</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pause: <strong>ESC key</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae</strong> Gamepad Controls: Left Stick</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost: B</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pause: Y</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\ud83d\udc51Lv.100!\ud83d\udc51","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2597500/056952dd524cc4c982c3140b424c3abc08c60b11.jpg"},{"name":"\u2b50\ufe0fLv.1\u2b50\ufe0f","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2597500/8b9b6b52187c58503cd08bf1f51e21f79d2036f1.jpg"},{"name":"\u2b50\ufe0fLv.2\u2b50\ufe0f","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2597500/b89d665f3ff78ef5bf9d53b67b1decdd445a423a.jpg"},{"name":"\u2b50\ufe0fLv.3\u2b50\ufe0f","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2597500/cb0c8bd7e2557e3abbdf4715c20a7c654be51082.jpg"},{"name":"\u2b50\ufe0fLv.4\u2b50\ufe0f","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2597500/c1441c903fbd86d409a536d821e0163c212e439a.jpg"},{"name":"\u2b50\ufe0fLv.5\u2b50\ufe0f","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2597500/4ed9663d8a10db03207b54544a00e578cafb2771.jpg"},{"name":"\u2b50\ufe0fLv.6\u2b50\ufe0f","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2597500/a3e8e2bfd65cce295916c3c36a14bdc3c7bdd6c1.jpg"},{"name":"\u2b50\ufe0fLv.7\u2b50\ufe0f","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2597500/4215c67a64c969b3fbade97d844b083bf9358aa0.jpg"},{"name":"\u2b50\ufe0fLv.8\u2b50\ufe0f","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2597500/e18117db91eda77345ad929a0827bac6c47ac851.jpg"},{"name":"\u2b50\ufe0fLv.9\u2b50\ufe0f","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2597500/4f4d9342976d5176352cbca5cfeda07f74c236f7.jpg"}],"total":100},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2597500?t=1757078219","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2597500?t=1757078219","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/3c908a3d97b2cd6852d4dc85ae202f24d050134b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757078219","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/3c908a3d97b2cd6852d4dc85ae202f24d050134b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757078219","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2713170,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2708\ufe0f<strong>Velocity Wings</strong>\u2708\ufe0f is an endless flying game where your goal is to fly 100KM through sheer perseverance! Earn all pilot medals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has no countdown timer, and no enemy planes chasing your tail. You can <strong>soar freely as you wish</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udc47This is your little plane. It looks cute, right? Don't underestimate it; it can fly forever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app