amai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/extras/1009db503d9c018e625590c91e75df88.poster.avif?t=1757078219\" width=374 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/extras/1009db503d9c018e625590c91e75df88.webm?t=1757078219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/extras/1009db503d9c018e625590c91e75df88.mp4?t=1757078219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Yes, your little plane can't stay boosted forever. Just like driving a car requires fuel, you need gas. But this little purple lightning bolt below can instantly refuel your plane, so keep that throttle pressed down and don't let go \ud83d\ude01.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/extras/1704a6d1711d2ecbcc3007bb10264ae5.poster.avif?t=1757078219\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/extras/1704a6d1711d2ecbcc3007bb10264ae5.webm?t=1757078219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/extras/1704a6d1711d2ecbcc3007bb10264ae5.mp4?t=1757078219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Next up is the main event. Don't be fooled by this ordinary, plain blue shield; it's actually a spatial warp device. Acquire it, and it will tear open a rift in reality for you to jump through. You can even grab a cup of coffee during the jump\u2014time to relax \ud83d\ude80.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: ce