s=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget your goal. This game has a total of <strong>100 achievements</strong>. Earn a medal for every kilometer flown! Only truly persistent pilots can obtain the <strong>gold-inlaid medal</strong> engraved with &quot;100KM!&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/extras/21c76b17e64f1e4f3fdde1dcd3eeac16.avif?t=1757078219\" width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alright, you've now fully mastered this game. Begin your flight journey immediately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f Warning: The crash rate for the first flight is as high as 97% (unofficial data, but if you survive, you earn bragging rights!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2328\ufe0f</strong> Keyboard Controls: \u2191 \u2193 \u2190 \u2192 <strong>/</strong> <strong>WSAD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost: <strong>Spacebar</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pause: <strong>ESC key</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae</strong> Gamepad Controls: Left Stick</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost: B</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pause: Y</p>","developers":["ZhiFeng Games"],"dlc":[3945990],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597500/1bd409e99923e7dbc47921592bb77fd345907eb4/header.jpg?t=1757078219","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</